@id n1_choirb
# DRAFT
# Brother Aldo, a young brother of the choir, in the nave at dusk (night 1). Background; friendly.
== start
(A young brother in the nave, humming a chant under his breath. He stops when he sees you.)
Aldo {amused}: Sorry. Tonight's psalm. I come in a beat behind Wulfric every night, and he never forgives me.
-> topics

== again
Aldo {glad}: Matins, porter. Ring it loud.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n1_choirb_count] How do I count the brothers at Matins? -> count

== count [set n1_choirb_count]
Aldo {calm}: Count the stalls. An empty one's a man still abed, and it's the porter who goes to fetch him.
-> end

== leave
Aldo {amused}: Loud, mind. Wulfric's half deaf.
